| Accessibility Checklist | https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.1 |
| Lighthouse Audits | https://developers.google.com/web/tools/lighthouse |
| PWA Starter Kit | https://github.com/vercel/next-pwa |

---

## 🎯 Summary Checklist

1. **Set up the project** (Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind).  
2. **Create core components** (Layout, Header, ProductCard).  
3. **Implement pages** (Shop, Cart, Product Detail).  
4. **Add state management** (Redux Toolkit or Zustand).  
5. **Integrate API** (REST or GraphQL).  
6. **Style responsively** (Tailwind).  
7. **Optimize performance** (Image, lazy load, ISR).  
8. **Write tests** (Jest + Cypress).  
9. **Deploy** (Vercel or Render).  

Follow this roadmap, tweak the stack to match your team’s expertise, and you’ll have a scalable, maintainable e‑commerce front‑end in no time. Happy coding!
